Third-party data

CORD v2 (receipt images and annotations) is used for evaluation.
Licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/naver-clova-ix/cord-v2
Park et al., "CORD: A Consolidated Receipt Dataset for Post-OCR Parsing", NeurIPS 2019 Workshop.

The data is not stored in this repository. scripts/fetch_public.sh downloads it into
data/public/ and converts a sample into this project's Receipt schema (items, totals,
IDR currency). Merchant and date are blurred in CORD, so they are left unlabeled
(PartialReceipt) and not scored.
